   * @desc      return IP address which is used by the UE for IMS signalling (IPv4 or IPv6)
   * @return    IP_AddrInfo_Type
   * @status    APPROVED (ENDC, IMS, IMS_IRAT, LTE, LTE_A_IRAT, LTE_A_PRO, LTE_A_R10_R11, LTE_A_R12, LTE_IRAT, MCX, NR5GC, NR5GC_IRAT, POS)
